{"seq":2,"slug":"release-process","title":"发布流程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-train-cadence","title":"发布火车与节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/release-train-cadence","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"artifact-promotion-pipeline","title":"制品晋升管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/artifact-promotion-pipeline","wordCount":1409,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"hotfix-emergency-release","title":"热修复与紧急发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/hotfix-emergency-release","wordCount":1463,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 发布流程\n\n版本策略回答\"叫什么\"，发布流程回答\"怎么发\"。本章聚焦于将已构建的软件制品从开发环境安全推进到生产环境的运营机制。\n\n三篇文档覆盖发布运营的三大支柱：发布火车与节奏定义了\"何时发\"的时间框架；制品晋升管道规定了制品从 dev 到 staging 再到 production 的质量门控路径；热修复与紧急发布则处理火车间隔之外的例外情况——当生产环境出现 P0 缺陷时如何快速修复并绕过常规节奏。\n"}